OL,3,GNEWSALine in the sand? Council set to
OL,4,Aban new beach food vans
OL,5,
OL,6,FAberdeen City Council is set to stop
OL,7,Fnew food and drink vans setting up at
OL,8,Fthe city's beachfront after concerns
OL,9,Fabout the number of street traders
OL,10,Foperating in the area.
OL,12,FA total of 36 businesses have
OL,13,Fpermission to set up there, ranging
OL,14,Ffrom burger and burrito bars to sweet
OL,15,Ftreats.
OL,17,FThe local authority will vote on
OL,18,Fproposals that could see no new
OL,19,Flicences granted while beach masterplan
OL,20,Fworks are ongoing and are recommending
OL,21,Fa presumption against street trading be
OL,22,Fbrought in.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
